<view class="screen"><brand-header/><view class="page-heading"><view class="kicker">ACTIVITY GUIDE</view><view class="page-title">活动规则</view><view class="page-subtitle">先了解规则，再带上好运出发。</view></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在加载规则…</view><view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="error-box">{{error}}<button class="secondary" bindtap="load">重新加载</button></view><block wx:else><view class="rule-section"><view class="rule-title">01 / 八重好礼 · 100% 中奖</view><view class="group">立减金奖品</view><view class="prob-row" wx:for="{{cash}}" wx:key="id"><text>{{item.name}}</text></view><view class="group">实物奖品</view><view class="prob-row" wx:for="{{physical}}" wx:key="id"><text>{{item.name}}</text></view><view class="copy">奖品随机抽取，名额发完即止。</view></view><view class="rule-section"><view class="rule-title">02 / 参与与领取</view><view class="copy">1. 每个微信账号在本次活动中有 1 次抽奖机会；参与成功即获得 1 份奖品。</view><view class="copy">2. 在「我的奖品」查看核销码，前往{{campaign.venue}}完成核销。</view><view class="copy">3. 实物由工作人员确认核销后发放；金额券用于购物抵扣，付款成功后核销，每张券仅可使用一次。</view><view class="copy">4. {{campaign.cashTerms}}</view></view><view class="rule-section"><view class="rule-title">03 / 活动时间</view><view class="copy">开始时间：{{campaign.startLabel}}<view>抽奖截止：{{campaign.endLabel}}</view><view>核销截止：{{campaign.redeemLabel}}</view>请在公示的截止时间前领取。</view></view><view class="rule-section"><view class="rule-title">04 / 隐私与帮助</view><view class="copy">本小程序使用微信账号标识记录参与资格和中奖结果，不要求填写手机号或通讯录。记录仅用于本次抽奖、防重复参与和奖品核销。关于数据查询、更正或删除，请联系活动现场主办方。</view><view wx:if="{{isDemo}}" class="copy">当前为演示版，数据仅保存在本机，可重置清除。</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="staff">工作人员核销入口 ↗</button><button wx:if="{{isDemo}}" class="reset" bindtap="reset">重置本地演示数据</button></view></block><bottom-nav active="rules"/></view>
